#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>特殊ルール： レベルアジャスト受注クラス・ジョブ制限</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>※本クエストは受注時のクラス・ジョブでのみ進行します。<br><br>リダ・ラーンのウィン＝ニイは、かくれんぼの練習をしているようだ。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Schwierigkeitsanpassung</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Die Schwierigkeit des Auftrags wird an die aktuelle Stufe angepasst und die Klasse (der Job) darf nicht gewechselt werden.<br><br>Uin Nee plant ein Versteckspiel-Training.
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Règle spéciale<nbsp>:  synchronisation de quête avec limitation de job ou de classe</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><i>Il n'est possible de progresser dans cette quête qu'avec la classe ou le job qui a servi à la commencer.</i><br><br>Uin Nee s'entraîne à jouer à cache-cache.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "Uin Nee is ostensibly practicing hiding and seeking, though they don't appear to be trying particularly hard at either at the moment.<br><br>※Please note that the difficulty of this quest has been synced to your current level. Furthermore, you may not proceed with a class or job that is different from when you accepted this quest."
msgstr ""

#. ja: プラ・エンニ茸窟で特訓中のピクシーを探し<br>チャットの「Say」モードで『ビーバー』と入力し呼びかける
#. de: „Hab dich!“ zu der versteckten Pixie in Pla Enni sagen
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, dire “Castor” à la Pixie cachée, à Pla Enni
#. kind: objective
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_TODO_00:1"
msgid "With the chat mode in <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Say</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, enter “Beaver” to let the pixie hiding in Pla Enni know that the game is up."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ウィン＝ニイと話す
#. de: Mit Uin Nee sprechen
#. fr: Parler à Uin Nee, à Lydha Lran
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Speak with Uin Nee."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ワタシたち、かくれんぼってだぁ～いすき！<br>夢の中でも子どもたちと一緒に、よく遊んでいるのよ。<br>本気になると、時間を忘れちゃうくらい！
#. de: Wir lieben das Versteckspiel! Wir spielen es auch oft mit den Kindern in der Traumwelt. Es macht so viel Spaß, dass wir darüber ganz die Zeit vergessen.
#. fr: Ah, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Je t'apprends peut-être qu'on adore jouer à cache-cache ici<nbsp>! Je me débrouille pas mal, d'ailleurs. Une fois, les autres ont mis des jours à me trouver<nbsp>! Hi hi, c'était trop rigolo<nbsp>!
#. speaker: UINNEE
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_UINNEE_000_001:1"
msgid "You found me! Oh, wait─it wasn't my turn to hide... Or was it?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: なかでもラケティカ大森林の、夜の民の子どもたちは、<br>みんな隠れるのも見つけるのも、とっても上手！<br>暗～い森で鍛えられた、特別な勘が働くのかしら……？
#. de: Die Kinder aus Rak'tika sind wirklich gut darin, sich zu verstecken und andere zu finden! Ob das daran liegt, dass sie das Spiel im dunklen Wald geübt haben?
#. fr: Mais les meilleurs à ce jeu, ce sont les enfants de Rak'tika<nbsp>! Ils sont vraiment trop forts<nbsp>! Ils sont même meilleurs que nous, tu te rends compte<nbsp>!?
#. speaker: UINNEE
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_UINNEE_000_002:1"
msgid "Hiding and seeking are both just too much fun! Especially with the little dreamers. Why, it's <i>so</i> much fun that sometimes, I forget that they're meant to wake up!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: いつもすぐに見つかっちゃって、あんまりに悔しいから、<br>ワタシたち、かくれんぼの大特訓が必要だと考えたの！<br>アナタも、ワタシたちの特訓に付き合ってもらえないかしら？
#. de: Ehrlich gesagt nagt es etwas an unserer Ehre, dass sie uns immer so schnell entdecken. Deshalb wollen wir lernen, uns besser zu verstecken. Willst du bei unserem Spe<shy>zial<shy>training mitmachen?
#. fr: Donc on a décidé de s'entraîner pour essayer de les battre. Tu veux bien te joindre à nous<nbsp>?
#. speaker: UINNEE
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_UINNEE_000_003:1"
msgid "Those little ones from the Rak'tika Greatwood, though, are far too good at this! And we <i>can't</i> keep letting them win─we have a reputation to uphold. That's why we've been training day and night! Mostly day, though. Do you want to join us?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: わーい！　友だちの「特訓中のピクシー」も喜ぶわ！<br>あの子は、暗～いプラ・エンニ茸窟に隠れているはずだから、<br>探し出せたら、「ビーバー！」って声をかけてみて！
#. de: Jaha, das wird ein Spaß! Eine Pixie hat sich schon in Pla Enni versteckt. Such sie und gib ihr mit den Worten „Hab dich!“ zu erkennen, dass du sie entdeckt hast.
#. fr: Youpi<nbsp>!<br>Les autres ont déjà commencé<nbsp>! Il faut que tu trouves leur cachette à Pla Enni et ensuite que tu cries “Castor”<nbsp>! 
#. speaker: UINNEE
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_UINNEE_000_004:1"
msgid "I'll let you have my turn as seeker, then! Do you know what to do when you've found someone? Sneak right up behind them and yell “Beaver”! ...Well, the sneaking and yelling are optional, but it's much more fun if you <i>really</i> scare the wings off of them!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ………………。<br>…………ま～だだよぉ……。
#. de: So leicht gebe ich mich nicht geschlagen<nbsp>...
#. fr: ...<br>J'en ai assez d'attendre Uin Nee...
#. speaker: KAKUREINOTIPIXIE
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_KAKUREINOTIPIXIE_000_010:1"
msgid "Goodness me, Uin Nee is worse at this than I thought! Maybe I'll have a nap..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: チャットの会話モードを「Say」モードにして、<br>キーボードやソフトウェアキーボードで『ビーバー』を含む、<br>好きな言葉を入力し、特訓中のピクシーに声をかけましょう。
#. de: Gib im „Sagen“-Chatmodus über Tastatur oder die virtuelle Tastatur „Hab dich!“ ein, um der versteckten Pixie klar<shy>zu<shy>machen, dass du sie entdeckt hast.
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, utilisez le clavier ou le clavier virtuel pour signifier à la Pixie que vous l'avez trouvée en lui disant “Castor”.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_SYSTEM_000_011:1"
msgid "With the chat mode in <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Say</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, use your keyboard or the software keyboard to enter “Beaver” to let the concealed pixie know that the game is up."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……！！<br>わわ、見つかっちゃったぁ！
#. de: Oje! Wie hast du mich so schnell gefunden?!
#. fr: Aaah<nbsp>!! <br>T'es qui, toi<nbsp>?
#. speaker: KAKUREINOTIPIXIE
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_KAKUREINOTIPIXIE_000_012:1"
msgid "Augh! Who are you!?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: これじゃあ、まだまだだね！<br>夜の民の子供たちは、本当にとっても手強いんだ！<br>う～ん悔しい、もっとうまく隠れられるようならなくちゃ……！
#. de: Ich muss noch besser werden! So haben wir keine Chance gegen die Kinder!
#. fr: Tssk... J'ai même pas choisi ma planque, c'est pas du jeu<nbsp>! Pfff... J'arriverai jamais à battre les enfants de Rak'tika<nbsp>! Allez, je dois retourner à l'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment...
#. speaker: KAKUREINOTIPIXIE
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_KAKUREINOTIPIXIE_000_013:1"
msgid "Uin Nee got a mortal to do their dirty work, did they? Hmph, you don't scare me! Not like those Viis children..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: おかえりなさい！<br>どうだった？　あの子は探し出せた……？
#. de: Na, wie lief es? Hast du die Pixie gefunden?
#. fr: Te revoilà<nbsp>! L'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment s'est bien passé<nbsp>?
#. speaker: UINNEE
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_UINNEE_000_020:1"
msgid "Well? Well!? Did you find them?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 見つかっちゃったかぁ～！<br>アナタもなかなか、かくれんぼの鬼役が上手なのね！
#. de: Hm, ich dachte mir schon, dass du sie finden würdest, aber das ging wirklich schnell!
#. fr: Eh bien... Toi aussi tu es plutôt <if $gn4>douée<else>doué</if> à cache-cache<nbsp>! La prochaine fois, j'aimerais voir ce que tu vaux quand c'est nous qui te cherchons. 
#. speaker: UINNEE
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_UINNEE_000_021:1"
msgid "You did! I knew you would─you're such a clever mortal. And now I'm going to show them how it's done! Just as soon as I remember whether I was hiding or seeking."
msgstr ""

#. ja: やっぱり夜の民のヒトたちみたいに、<br>常に森の陰でかくれんぼをする生活をしなくちゃかしら……。<br>ワタシたち、もっともっと特訓を重ねていくわ！
#. de: Wir müssen uns noch viel mehr in den Schatten bewegen, so wie die Untertanen der Nacht!
#. fr: Je me demande si ce ne serait pas plus efficace qu'on aille s'entraîner à Rak'tika<nbsp>! Il y a bien plus de cachettes qu'ici et il fait tellement sombre qu'on y voit rien... C'est sûrement pour ça que les enfants sont si doués<nbsp>!
#. speaker: UINNEE
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_UINNEE_000_022:1"
msgid "Once we've had a bit more practice, those children won't stand a chance! Muahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ビーバー
#. de: Hab dich!
#. fr: Castor
#. speaker: SAYTODO
msgctxt "quest/037/BanPix124_03712:TEXT_BANPIX124_03712_SAYTODO_000_030:1"
msgid "Beaver"
msgstr ""
